   "updated": 1793932307461,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HAProxy  \u00b7  listens VIP:443 (+127.0.0.1)\n\n\u2460 terminates client TLS (cert by SNI)\n\u2022 deletes client X-Forwarded-For\n\u2022 adds XFF = real client IP\n\u2022 routes by Host \u2192 be_app1 / be_app2\n\u2022 leastconn over ALL agents\n\u2022 health checks + retries",
   "originalText": "HAProxy  \u00b7  listens VIP:443 (+127.0.0.1)\n\n\u2460 terminates client TLS (cert by SNI)\n\u2022 deletes client X-Forwarded-For\n\u2022 adds XFF = real client IP\n\u2022 routes by Host \u2192 be_app1 / be_app2\n\u2022 leastconn over ALL agents\n\u2022 health checks + retries",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "zAazGdgX6DUw2oOBAiWQ",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
